  "stem": "A sphere has a radius of \\(3\\). The volume of the sphere is \\(k\\pi\\). What is the value of \\(k\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "36"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "The volume of a sphere is \\(V = \\frac{4}{3}\\pi r^{3}\\).",
    "\\(V = \\frac{4}{3}\\pi (27) = 36\\pi\\), so \\(k = 36\\)."
  ],
